# The rows of src/baseclasses/Shader.h and src/baseclasses/Shader.cpp, a call each (src/tools/bench/bench.py).

## Shader.cpp/Shader::Shader a damaged shader
holds: a damaged shader is refused naming its file, or read

## Shader.cpp/Shader::Shader a local size zeroed
views/library/start/Name.comp.spv, its local size's x zeroed -> throws runtime_error: "<root>/zeroed.spv is damaged: its local size 0 by 1 by 1 holds no invocation"
views/library/start/Name.comp.spv, its local size's y zeroed -> throws runtime_error: "<root>/zeroed.spv is damaged: its local size 64 by 0 by 1 holds no invocation"
views/library/start/Name.comp.spv, its local size's z zeroed -> throws runtime_error: "<root>/zeroed.spv is damaged: its local size 64 by 1 by 0 holds no invocation"

## Shader.cpp/Shader::Shader every shader of the build
every shader of the build but the mistakes' reflects

